    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Geraghty are delighted to bring to market this quaint 1 bedroom detached cottage located close to the village of Ratoath with an abundance of eateries, shops and restaurants all within a short stroll. Dating back to approx. 1899, this is a unique listing; a cottage that has stood the test of time, where you will discover the perfect blend of heritage and contemporary elegance in this beautifully restored Gate Lodge Cottage. Nestled on its own site at the entrance of The Grange residential development, the cottage offers both privacy and charm yet is located within minutes of the village centre. Bus stop to the capital is a short distance and the cottage itself has parking for 2 cars.Inside, you'll find a thoughtfully designed interior that retains some of its original character combined with modern finishes. The living area and bedroom welcomes natural light through cottage-style windows. While retaining its traditional charm, modern comforts include gas-fired central heating and double-glazed windows, ensuring warmth and efficiency all year round. Whether you're seeking a charming weekend escape, a full-time residence, or an exclusive guest property, The Gate Lodge Cottage captures the essence of town living with a feeling of countryside living, it is a very special property which can only be fully appreciated on viewing!This is a home offering character, charm, and contemporary comforts in equal measure and we look forward to showing you around."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nKitchen Living Dining - \nA bright space with aspects on three sides, fully equipped kitchen with built in oven, hob and extractor fan, peninsula island\n\nBedroom - \nA double room with built in wardrobes.\n\nEntrance Hall - \nHardwood front door with timber flooring underfoot.\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled with bath unit, Velux window.\n\nUtilities - \nGas Fired Central HeatingMains Services\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Excellent location within a 5 minute stroll of the village centre</li><li>Bus stop to the Capital a short walk</li><li>Retail complex close by with convenience store, pharmacy and coffee house</li><li>Beautifully restored with attention to heritage details</li><li>Modern kitchen and bathroom fittings</li><li>Private garden and outdoor seating area</li><li>Ideal as a holiday home, rental investment, or quiet retreat</li><li>Located within minutes walking distance of Ratoath Village, shopping complex, pharmacy etc close by</li><li>Ratoath village is located 25 kms from Dublin City Centre and circa 10 kms from the M3.</li><li>Dunboyne M3 Park and Ride facility 10km perfect for Dublin commuters</li><li>Located within proximity to Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, with its many shops and amenities.</li><li>Home to Fairyhouse Racecourse and Tattersalls, Emerald Park to name but a few</ul>"
      },
      {
